The fix is to normalize the ids to the plain form the metrics table keys on. The helper already exists and is already imported at the top of this same file: normalizeActivityId, from ../db/paradigm. Its own doc comment states its purpose exactly — "Variant-family consumers (variant_performance_metrics, v_activity_score) key on the plain id, so we strip table prefix + bracket wrappers". It is idempotent on already-plain ids.

